Determine the area of the proposed Nirimba Fields development using the Six Maps website.

Instructions:

i. Go to the website: maps.six.nsw.gov.au/

ii. Close any opening messages on the website.

iii. Find the search bar at the top left corner and search Nirimba Fields.

\exfigure{3307_q1_1}

iv. Ensure you have found the area seen in the picture below and are observing the correct image of the region. You may need to zoom in or out to achieve this.

\exfigure{3307_q1_2}

v. Select the area tool to take your measurement.

